er players than are known  about around the country making this  debate essential this just add to that  wider debate about safety in rugby so it  it's very very important that world  rugby  take this issue and it's very very  important that they're there leading the  discussion and be interesting to see how  other sports might follow the revised  guidelines will take weeks or even  months to decide upon with such a  fiendishly difficult and divisive issue  world rugby is putting itself on the  front foot Martha Kellner Sky News
 

